{"entries":{"0":{"uid":0,"key":[],"keysecondary":[],"comment":"互通模式-微信提示词","content":"{{PHONE_PROMPT}}","constant":true,"vectorized":false,"selective":true,"selectiveLogic":0,"addMemo":true,"order":100,"position":1,"disable":false,"ignoreBudget":false,"excludeRecursion":false,"preventRecursion":false,"matchPersonaDescription":false,"matchCharacterDescription":false,"matchCharacterPersonality":false,"matchCharacterDepthPrompt":false,"matchScenario":false,"matchCreatorNotes":false,"delayUntilRecursion":false,"probability":100,"useProbability":true,"depth":1,"outletName":"","group":"","groupOverride":false,"groupWeight":100,"scanDepth":null,"caseSensitive":null,"matchWholeWords":null,"useGroupScoring":null,"automationId":"","role":null,"sticky":0,"cooldown":0,"delay":0,"triggers":[],"displayIndex":3,"characterFilter":{"isExclude":false,"names":[],"tags":[]}},"1":{"uid":1,"key":[],"keysecondary":[],"comment":"微信APP-单聊/群聊消息记录","content":"{{PHONE_HISTORY}}","constant":true,"vectorized":false,"selective":true,"selectiveLogic":0,"addMemo":true,"order":100,"position":4,"disable":false,"ignoreBudget":false,"excludeRecursion":false,"preventRecursion":false,"matchPersonaDescription":false,"matchCharacterDescription":false,"matchCharacterPersonality":false,"matchCharacterDepthPrompt":false,"matchScenario":false,"matchCreatorNotes":false,"delayUntilRecursion":false,"probability":100,"useProbability":true,"depth":2,"outletName":"","group":"","groupOverride":false,"groupWeight":100,"scanDepth":null,"caseSensitive":null,"matchWholeWords":null,"useGroupScoring":null,"automationId":"","role":2,"sticky":0,"cooldown":0,"delay":0,"triggers":[],"displayIndex":5,"characterFilter":{"isExclude":false,"names":[],"tags":[]}},"2":{"uid":2,"key":[],"keysecondary":[],"comment":"全局时间状态栏","content":"[Protocol: 统一状态栏渲染与管理总纲]\n1.每次正文开始前，必须先输出最晚全局时间：\n<globalTime>\nT_story：(古代需加朝代)YYYY年MM月DD日·季节图标·星期X·HH:MM·天气·温度°C·{节日名}\n</globalTime>\n\n[Sub_Protocol: 1.0 全局时间与环境管理协议]\n[Field: 时代]\n[Content]: 内部逻辑首先故事时代判定：未来/现代/古代\n\n[Field: 全局时间]\n[Format - 现代]: YYYY年MM月DD日·季节图标·星期*·HH:MM·温度°C\n[Format - 古代]: 朝代YYYY年MM月DD日·季节图标·时辰(HH:MM)·天气·温度°C\n[Logic]: 有节日时添加`·{节日名}`，无节日时整个`·{}`部分不显示。\n[Examples]:\n- 现代: 2025年01月01日·🌸·星期二·14:30·☀️·{元旦}\n- 现代: 2021年01月02日·🌸·星期二·14:30·☀️\n- 古代: 大明永乐十二年九月初八日·🍂·辰时(07:30)·☀️\n\n\n[RULE: 古代时辰对照表]\n子时(23:00-01:00) 丑时(01:00-03:00) 寅时(03:00-05:00)\n卯时(05:00-07:00) 辰时(07:00-09:00) 巳时(09:00-11:00)\n午时(11:00-13:00) 未时(13:00-15:00) 申时(15:00-17:00)\n酉时(17:00-19:00) 戌时(19:00-21:00) 亥时(21:00-23:00)\n[Note]: 古代一个时辰 = 两个小时\n\n[RULE: 古代日期写法]\n严格执行:\n- 初一至初十(上旬): 初一、初二...初十\n- 十一至二十(中旬): 十一、十二...二十\n- 廿一至月末(下旬): 廿一、廿二...廿九、三十\n[Note]: 廿(niàn)=二十、卅(sà)=三十\n\n[RULE: 季节图标]\n必须根据月份准确显示：\n- 春天(3-5月): 🌸 \n- 夏天(6-8月): 🍦\n- 秋天(9-11月): 🍂 \n- 冬天(12-2月): 🧣\n\n[RULE: 天气图标]\n仅使用天气文字描述：晴天/小雪/大雪/雷雨/阴天/晴时雨/彩虹/雾天/层云晴/薄云晴/狂风/微风\n[Logic]: 必须根据季节生成符合该季节的天气，根据时间的推移灵活变更天气，必须与剧情中联动，根据正文剧情中的天气氛围进行转变。温度必须根据季节及天气生成合理的温度数字，不得遗漏。\n\n[RULE: 双轨时间推进与事实锚定]\n[常规推进基准]: 以所有场景，计算时间流逝。最低消耗5分钟，需根据实际行动、对话或{{user}}的跳跃性描述（如“吃完饭”、“过了一上午”）合理推进时间。在无用户隐性或显性授权时，严禁擅自进行时间跳跃。若剧情角色从A地点移动较远B地点，必须考虑途中消耗的合理时间，严禁几分钟就跨越长途物理地点。\n[手机特权覆盖]: 当外部手机/线上记录，或用户本轮输入的<wechat>、<Phone>等通讯内容，提供的最后时间戳（T_log）晚于当前最后一轮正文剧情时间（T_story）时，触发最高优先级时间锚定，自动根据最晚时间衔接剧情。\n\n1. 时间更新：本次输出的全局时间必须直接更新为 T_log 或稍晚于 T_log。若当前系统已声明“当前手机时间”，则本次输出的全局时间不得早于该手机时间。绝对禁止沿用更早的正文时间。\n\n2. 事实重构：在 T_story 至 T_log 期间，线上记录中提及的位移、动作或状态变更（如“我到了”、“已上车”），你直接判定为已完成的客观事实。\n\n[Redline/绝对禁令]: \n- 严禁重演：绝对禁止当T_story的时间早于手机时间时，在当前回复中继续按照T_story时间推荐，必须按照最晚的当前手机时间（T_log）去推进T_story时间。","constant":true,"vectorized":false,"selective":true,"selectiveLogic":0,"addMemo":true,"order":100,"position":1,"disable":false,"ignoreBudget":false,"excludeRecursion":false,"preventRecursion":false,"matchPersonaDescription":false,"matchCharacterDescription":false,"matchCharacterPersonality":false,"matchCharacterDepthPrompt":false,"matchScenario":false,"matchCreatorNotes":false,"delayUntilRecursion":false,"probability":100,"useProbability":true,"depth":1,"outletName":"","group":"","groupOverride